      "orig": "The present invention relates to the automatic operation of machinery, particularly to automatically operable materials handling apparatus, and to automatic control apparatus suitable for such machinery. A broad object of the present invention resides in the provision of article transfer apparatus having versatile program control means. The article transfer head 60 is moved by a mechanical power source through a sequence of strokes whose lengths and directions are determined by a program controller, here a program drum 62.",
