      "orig": "From the earliest years in the mechanical handling of articles there have been but two types of machine control: cam control and manual control. Manually controlled article handling equipment has the highly desirable property of being most flexible, but entails the high cost of operating manpower.",
      "text": "From the earliest years in the mechanical handling of articles there have been but two types of machine control: cam control and manual control. Manually controlled article handling equipment has the highly desirable property of being most flexible, but entails the high cost of operating manpower."
