      ],
      "orig": "The present invention makes available for the first time a more or less general purpose machine that has universal application to a vast diversity of applications where cyclic control is desired. Universal automation, or Unimation, is a term that may well characterize the general object of the invention.",
      "text": "The present invention makes available for the first time a more or less general purpose machine that has universal application to a vast diversity of applications where cyclic control is desired. Universal automation, or Unimation, is a term that may well characterize the general object of the invention."
