      ],
      "orig": "In applying one feature of this invention, the article transfer head 60 (whether it takes the form of jaws, a suction gripper, or other comparable article-handling tool) is moved by a mechanical power source through a sequence of strokes whose lengths and directions are determined by a program controller, i.e. program drum 62.",
      "text": "In applying one feature of this invention, the article transfer head 60 (whether it takes the form of jaws, a suction gripper, or other comparable article-handling tool) is moved by a mechanical power source through a sequence of strokes whose lengths and directions are determined by a program controller, i.e. program drum 62."
