      "orig": "An especially desirable form of program controller combined with the transter mechanism to be controlled represents a further feature of the invention. The transfer mechanism operates the transfer head and at the same time displaces a position detector; the position detector is compared through a feedback loop with the program controller until coincidence is reached.",
      "text": "An especially desirable form of program controller combined with the transter mechanism to be controlled represents a further feature of the invention. The transfer mechanism operates the transfer head and at the same time displaces a position detector; the position detector is compared through a feedback loop with the program controller until coincidence is reached."
